; The "Macarena wing": an F1-style two-element rear wing whose flap ROTATES
; about its own center, from the high-downforce pose to a flat, low-drag one
; and back. Both profiles are inverted NACA sections (camber down), so lift is
; negative: this wing pushes DOWN. Watch the wake collapse when the flap flips.
